{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Judgment\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-10\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The Marleyan military's air force invades Paradis, while Eren Yeager continues battling Porco Galliard, who is soon joined by Reiner Braun in his Armored Titan form.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8932418/screencap/61d8a800e4269.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"断罪\"},{\"title\":\"Sneak Attack\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-17\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The Beast Titan joins the fray, but General Magath is determined to take him down. Meanwhile, with the city in flames, Colt and Gabi rush to rescue Falco who's held captive by the Jaegerists.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8935534/screencap/61dba38184d20.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"騙し討ち\"},{\"title\":\"Two Brothers\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-24\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Colt pleads with Zeke to not use his scream and turn Falco into a Titan. All the while, soldiers and Titans clash in battle as Eren struggles to make contact with his brother.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8935535/screencap/61e49d0ec3470.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"兄と弟\"},{\"title\":\"Memories of the Future\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-31\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Zeke takes Eren through Grisha's memories to show him how he's been brainwashed. But in doing so, Zeke discovers something about Eren that he never knew.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8945752/screencap/622f5e4258098.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"未来の記憶\"},{\"title\":\"From You, 2,000 Years Ago\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-07\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"This is the story of those who have been resisting, struggling, and continually advancing for 2,000 years. Who the hell started this story? Eren speaks to Founder Ymir, who continues walking, \\\"You were waiting... All this time. For 2,000 years... Waiting for someone...\\\"\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8947991/screencap/61f6bafcc9e2e.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"二千年前の君から\"},{\"title\":\"Thaw\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-14\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"With no walls left on the island and Shiganshina full of Titans, the Scouts must battle their former comrades. In the midst of it all, Gabi is determined to find and rescue Falco at whatever cost.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8947992/screencap/62070214e7e8a.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"氷解\"},{\"title\":\"Sunset\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-21\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The rumbling is set in motion once all hardening is undone, but this also sets Annie free. As the Jaegerists take control of the island, Connie races towards Ragako to feed Falco to his Titan mother.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8947993/screencap/6214089315748.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"夕焼け\"},{\"title\":\"Pride\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-28\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Upon reaching Ragako, Connie hatches a plan to trick Falco into being eaten by his mother. Elsewhere, hero of the Eldian Empire, Jean, is to execute Yelena and Onyankopon for their crimes against humanity.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8947994/screencap/621c00c743de3.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"矜持\"},{\"title\":\"Night of the End\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-07\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Deep in the forest, an unlikely rabble of Marley stragglers and island fugitives attempt to set their hatred aside and talk around a campfire without killing each other.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8947995/screencap/6222d467ca7cc.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"終末の夜\"},{\"title\":\"Traitor\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-14\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The Azumabito’s flying boat is guarded by a port full of Jaegerists, but the Scouts are reluctant to kill their former friends. If they wish to avoid bloodshed, they can't afford their plan to go wrong.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8947996/screencap/622a21c1dd0ab.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"裏切り者\"},{\"title\":\"Retrospective\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-21\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"For the flying boat to take off, the mechanics need half a day to service it. Knowing they'll never last that long with Jaegerist reinforcements on the way, the crew is forced to change their plans.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8947997/screencap/622f6b6e93206.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"懐古\"},{\"title\":\"The Dawn of Humanity\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2022-04-04\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Regardless of where it all began, Eren commits to his path of destruction during the Scouts' first visit to the Marleyan mainland, leaving Mikasa to wonder if things could've been different.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8947998/screencap/6237b6371725a.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"人類の夜明け\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}